# Docker build context is the repository root (see deploy/intranet/docker-compose.yml).
# Keep the context small and free of local artefacts and secrets.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
.git/
.handoff/
.cursor/
.tmp/
dist/
portable/
logs/
node_modules/
dotnet/artifacts/
dotnet/tests/
dotnet/tools/
dotnet/src/CabinetNC.Desktop/
dotnet/src/CabinetNC.Desktop.Core/
dotnet/src/CabinetNC.ComputeWorker/
native/
public/
src/
deploy/intranet/.env
deploy/intranet/.env.*
!deploy/intranet/.env.example
deploy/intranet/certs/*
!deploy/intranet/certs/.gitkeep
*.zip
*.log
